{"ts":"2026-07-11T13:53:53.710Z","author":"codex","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T13:53:53.710Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-11T13:53:53.710Z","author":"codex","text":"Audit finding: the publishable legal pages and README previously mixed reusable package artifacts with a named hosted operator/contact/address, hosted-service domains, jurisdiction/regulator references, retention/logging assertions, integration data-flow assertions, and hosted-service terms. No concrete credentials, tokens, private keys, production data, or production-derived fixtures were found in the npm publish set. Public GitHub repository metadata and generic example.com form placeholders are intentional package-source/example values."}]}],"before_hash":"efc1b18b9403e04e1e5a40f113b2f19bb4dd5c1b3fab74219b56a37b5ad94b08","after_hash":"f14f3d4793f93dcb12093ea3d34e87e96cfdc7e81215d71454129e9d971997ef"}
{"ts":"2026-07-11T13:53:54.924Z","author":"codex","op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T13:53:54.924Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-11T13:53:54.894Z","author":"codex","text":"A reusable npm package cannot safely ship a hosted operator's legal promises. Keep bundled pages visibly non-legal placeholders and make the deployment overlay absolute, complete, path-contained, and startup-failing so production cannot silently mix package placeholders with private notices."}]}],"before_hash":"f14f3d4793f93dcb12093ea3d34e87e96cfdc7e81215d71454129e9d971997ef","after_hash":"8077240140695f2ec940640b498d5abaec729f549f45b8655bc1e981cdee6f4c"}
{"ts":"2026-07-11T13:53:56.461Z","author":"codex","op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-11T13:53:56.459Z","author":"codex","text":"This host's npm user config defines allow-scripts in a form npm 11 injects into audit/pack and rejects for project-scoped operations. Isolating NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null validates public registry audit/pack without modifying or exposing the host credential-bearing npm config."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T13:53:56.461Z"}],"before_hash":"8077240140695f2ec940640b498d5abaec729f549f45b8655bc1e981cdee6f4c","after_hash":"2386e7f3ac21ac56911ebeb809c5c20169c3e27f489c81e066e44a754efbbbc0"}
